:: Endings {"position":"600,425"}
<<set $bgUsesLevel = false>>
<<if $finalBucket > 0>>
  <<audio "BG-waveSeagull" stop>>
  <<audio "BG-goodEnding" play loop>>
  <<set $bgType = "good">>
  When the ship docked at port that morning, Em Ploughy exited with the passengers as they headed to their excursions for the day, suitcase in hand. Dahler Bill offered to promote her to be his third Executive Assistant, and she had just one word for him:
  “No.”
  Now, lounging on the beach and soaking up the sun with a tropical beverage in hand, Em feels energized and confident. She knows that no matter what the future holds for her, work related or otherwise, she will always have the confidence to advocate for herself. 
<<else>>
  <<audio "BG-waveSeagull" stop>>
  <<audio "BG-badEnding" play loop>>
  <<set $bgType = "bad">>
  The horizon was obscured in the wake of the storm raging outside from Em Ploughy’s vantage point on the deck. Pelted by rain and hair whipping her face, she stands alone. She's well and truly trapped on the Great Dette after accepting a promotion to become Dahler Bill’s third Executive Assistant. 
  She wonders how she ended up here, and when things started to go awry. Reflecting over the last 3 days, there’s one word she wishes she would have had the courage to use.
  “No.”
<</if>>

:: Day3_End {"position":"1250,100","size":"100,100"}
<<if ($dailyBucket > 0)>> 
  <<audio "BG-goodDay" play>>
	<<if $bgLevel < 3 >>
    <<set $bgType = "sunny">>
    <<set $bgLevel += 1>>
  <</if>>
  Em Ploughy is so energized after advocating for herself today! Even Sue Ingyou’s bad attitude couldn’t stop her from enjoying her newfound confidence. Hopefully, tomorrow Em can keep up the good work and continue to stand up for herself. 
<<elseif ($dailyBucket < 0)>>
  <<audio "BG-badDay" play>>
	<<if $bgLevel < 3 >>
    <<set $bgType = "stormy">>
    <<set $bgLevel += 1>> 
  <</if>>
  Em Ploughy was exhausted after fulfilling all those requests. Sue Ingyou did a number on her self confidence, she could hardly believe she got away with sneaking those chips away from the table! At least Sue Ingyou left a good review for her. Hopefully, one day Em can find the courage to stand up for herself. 
<</if>>

<div class = "choice">
[[What's in the future?->Endings][$finalBucket += $dailyBucket,$dailyBucket = 0]]
</div>

:: Day3_Elder_R3 {"position":"1150,550","size":"100,100"}
<<audio "SFX-casino2" play>>
<<if $bgLevel < 3 >>
  <<set $bgType = "stormy">>
  <<set $bgLevel += 1>>
<</if>>
The old woman is quickly spending Em Ploughy’s already limited funds! She’s ringing up a crazy bill! 

“Um, I think the machine is working now,” Em Ploughy cringes and slowly reaches towards the machine, “I’m going to take my card back now.” 

The old woman smacks her hand away and completely ignores her. “Say, you sure wasted a lot of my time today. You really should be compensating me.”

Sue Ingyou momentarily tears her eyes away from the slot machine screen to light another cigarette. 

“At least we’re in a smoking zone now” Em Ploughy mumbled.

“The card dealer at that table over there isn’t paying attention, go grab me some chips!” The woman insists gleefully, “Make sure it’s the high value ones after everything you’ve put me through!” 

<div class = "choice">
[[After 3 days of nonstop insanity, Em Ploughy has had enough, “NO! I will not be stealing! Go ahead and complain to my boss, I’m done! And give me my card back!” ->Day3_End][$dailyBucket +=20]]
[[Em Ploughy sneaks over and snags some chips while the card dealer is distracted by the storm raging outside to appease the old woman.->Day3_End][$dailyBucket -=5]]
</div>

:: Day3_Elder_R2 {"position":"1100,400","size":"100,100"}
<<audio "SFX-casino1" play>>
<<if $bgLevel < 3 >>
  <<set $bgType = "stormy">>
  <<set $bgLevel += 1>>
<</if>>
When she arrives at the casino, the old woman is already in the well worn seat of a “Murphy the Moose Mines a Million” themed slot machine. 

“Someone exited out of my game!” She griped, “You need to put your credit card in the machine so I can show you how it took my money!”

<div class = "choice">
[[Em Ploughy says no, this is ridiculous, and calls the casino staff over to resolve the issue.->Day3_End][$dailyBucket +=20]]
[[Em Ploughy reluctantly gets her wallet out and inserts her credit card. She really doesn’t want to, but if Sue Ingyou complains, the boss will terminate her!->Day3_Elder_R4][$dailyBucket -=5]]
</div>

:: Day3_Dog_R2 {"position":"1300,775","size":"100,100"}
Dahler Bill responds saying he doesn't have time to deal with the dog right now. He tells her to find the owner or call security. One more thing for her to do list...

<div class = "choice">
[[She gets back to work.->Day3_Elder_R3]]
</div>

:: Day3_Dog_R1 {"position":"1150,675","size":"100,100"}
She leans down and the dog turns over completely for her to pet his belly. She spends a couple of minutes happily petting Bandit until he releases slight huff and gets up to continue his adventure.

<div class = "choice">
