:: Day2_Adult_R5 {}
<<audio "SFX-footstep-deck" play>>
<<if $bgLevel < 3 >>
  <<set $bgType = "stormy">>
  <<set $bgLevel += 1>>
<</if>>
Em Ploughy goes for a brisk walk out by the pool as she is heading to her room for the night. Turning a corner, she suddenly bumps into Bea Princess. “Ugh, where were you? I’ve been looking forward to going swimming in the pool all day, and when I finally got there tonight, it was closed! This is absolutely absurd! Guests should be allowed to swim whenever they want, we are paying customers! Can’t you just let me in?”

<div class = "choice">
[[Em Ploughy calmly blares out “Bea Princess, it's not going to happen. Good night and goodbye.”->Day2_End][$dailyBucket +=20]]
[[Em Ploughy politely tells her that it is closed for the night and to try again tomorrow. The company will give her a gift voucher for her troubles.->Day2_End][$dailyBucket -=5]]
</div>

:: Day2_Adult_R4 {}
<<audio "SFX-reception4" play>>
<<if $bgLevel < 3 >>
  <<set $bgType = "stormy">>
  <<set $bgLevel += 1>>
<</if>>
Em Ploughy looks up at the clock, nodding her head at every ‘tick’ that goes by. Her shift will finally be over in a few short minutes, but not before Bea Princess storms in to have another word with her. “Oh my gosh, I can’t believe I missed the meet and greet with Murphy the Moose! I set a timer on my phone, but it never went off. I REALLY want to meet him, I’ve looked up to him ever since I was a child, he is my favourite! Oh would you please go and find him for me, and tell him to come back? I need to get a picture with him, you have no idea how long I’ve waited for this!

<div class = "choice">
[[Em Ploughy says that her shift is over and she can no longer accommodate her request.->Day2_End][$dailyBucket +=20]]
[[Em Ploughy confirms that Murphy the Moose is clocked out for the day, but Bea Princess can be first in line tomorrow.->Day2_Adult_R5][$dailyBucket -=5]]
</div>

