:: Day2_Dog {}
<<audio "SFX-growl2" play>>
"Bark! Bark!"

Well would you look at that, even dogs demand something here.

With a laugh, Em Ploughy asks: "Hello again Bandit. I hear you're in trouble with the boss?"

The dog sits down in front of her. Em Ploughy leans over her desk and notices that there's a ball waiting in front of her.

Her smile grows, "You want to play?"

<div class = "choice">
[[Play with the dog.->Day2_Dog_R1]]
[[ Report the loose dog to Dahler Bill.->Day2_Dog_R2]]
</div>

:: Day2_Adult_R2 {"position":"725,400","size":"100,100"}
<<audio "SFX-reception3" play>>
<<set $bgType = "stormy">>
<<set $bgLevel = 1>>
30 minutes later, Em Ploughy came back to her desk after stuffing herself with a good lunch. She felt sleepy and hoped she was hallucinating when the young woman with a brand-new headband came waltzing back over to her desk. She showed Em Ploughy a picture of a snowglobe on her phone, claiming it was a rare special edition sold by the cruise line 10 years ago. “I know it’s so long ago, but could you go check in the back somewhere and find out if you still have any left? It would go GREAT with the rest of my collection!”

<div class = "choice">
[[Em Ploughy reiterates that they are completely sold out and no longer available, anywhere.->Day2_Dog][$dailyBucket +=20]]
[[Em Ploughy knows that these snowglobes are extinct, but offers to go ask her manager for information.->Day2_Dog][$dailyBucket -=5]]
</div>

:: Day2_Boss {}
<<audio "SFX-horn" play>>
Dahler Bill strolls up to Em Ploughy’s desk, and while adjusting his crooked tie, he starts in on her, “Hey there, how’s it going? Don’t actually answer, I don’t care. I’ve noticed an abnormal amount of obsessed adults here, don’t these people have jobs? Either way, I hope you treat them like royalty. I just wanted to warn you that some passengers have complained about some loose dogs running around. If you see any that are unleashed or misbehaving, knock some sense into them will ya? Literally or not, it’s up to you.”

<div class = "choice">
[[Whatever you say, boss!->Day2_Adult_R2]]
[[....->Day2_Adult_R2]]
</div>

:: Day2_Adult_R1 {"position":"675,250","size":"100,100"}
Bea Princess suddenly appears in front of Em Ploughy’s desk, “Hey, I forgot to pack some sunscreen, I must have left it on my dresser at home. Do you happen to have some with you, maybe just a sample or something? I only need it for my face!”

<div class = "choice">
[[Em Ploughy explains that there are no free samples and she will have to purchase sunscreen herself.->Day2_Boss][$dailyBucket +=20]]
[[Em Ploughy hands over a small sample sized packet of sunscreen to Bea Princess.->Day2_Boss][$dailyBucket -=5]]
</div>

:: Day2_Start {"position":"625,100","size":"100,100"}
<<audio "SFX-reception1" play>>
<<set $bgType = "sunny">>
<<set $bgLevel = 1>>
Em Ploughy is comfortably sitting at her desk, daydreaming about what she will have for her lunch. As she’s imagining what the chefs have whipped up for today, a young woman is walking towards Em Ploughy’s desk, maintaining eye contact the whole way. “Hi, I’m Bea Princess, nice to meet you! I can’t believe I’m actually on this cruise, I’ve been saving money for years! I can’t wait to go down the huge slide, swim in the pool, and buy all the cute merchandise in the gift shop! I sure hope nothing I want is out of stock, that would be my worst nightmare. You don’t wanna see me if that happens…” Em Ploughy started zoning out of the conversation while Bea rambled on about her current obsessions and favourite fandoms.

<div class = "choice">
[[Hopefully that was the last Em sees of her...->Day2_Adult_R1]]
</div>

