  <b> Welcome to Seas the day!</b>
* This is a ‘choose your own adventure’ style visual novel. 
* Em Ploughy has a limited amount of energy, and you get to decide how much of it she uses over the 3 day cruise.
* Every decision you make impacts the ending, so choose wisely. 
* Headphones are recommended.  

Are you ready to <b>seize the day</b> and protect your boundaries and energy?
